WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:04.170
Hey, everyone. Tickets are now on sale for Marvel Studio's Black Widow.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.214
We have to go back to where it all started. 

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.971
Grab your tickets today or else. 

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:14.639
Or else what?

00:00:14.999 --> 00:00:16.558
Or else...

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.268
you know...

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.478
David! What! No, we're not doing that. 

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:20.770
What? 

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:25.442
You know, it's a gesture for "or else you won't have tickets."

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.650
That...no, David. 

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:26.860
Yeah.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.277
That's not...

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.528
That's what that gesture means.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:28.945
No, but...

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:29.738
Get your tickets now!

